URL: https://gfcafe.preview.resto.cloud/admin/stock-manager#overview
Path: Sidebar -> Catalog -> Stock Manager -> "Обзор" tab
Description: General view of the Stock Manager. Shows groups/categories of products. Supports searching and tab switching between "Нет в наличии" and "Обзор".

Annotation:
- Spotlight over the groups row with the label "Навигация по категориям".
- Red oval around the "Добавки" category card.
- Small red oval on the eye icon for the highlighted group to show the visibility toggle.
